1
00:00:00,145 --> 00:00:02,145
(Mary Cooper:)Thank you for picking me up.

2
00:00:02,147 --> 00:00:04,617
(Sheldon:)Oh, you're welcome.

3
00:00:04,617 --> 00:00:06,987
(Mary:)I was speaking to
your young lady.

4
00:00:06,986 --> 00:00:08,686
(Amy:)My pleasure, Mrs. Cooper.

5
00:00:08,687 --> 00:00:09,957
(Mary:)Oh, please call me Mary.

6
00:00:09,955 --> 00:00:12,385
(Amy:)Okay, Mary.

7
00:00:13,626 --> 00:00:15,356
(Penny:)You know,
that doesn't work for me,

8
00:00:15,361 --> 00:00:17,591
(Sheldon:)let's stay with Mrs. Cooper.

9
00:00:17,596 --> 00:00:19,566
(Mary:)Sheldon, don't be silly.

10
00:00:19,565 --> 00:00:20,995
Wait, what?

11
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,160
(Sheldon:)That's what I called you
till I got to know you better.

12
00:00:24,169 --> 00:00:27,769
(Mary:)It was so nice of Leonard
and Penny to invite me.

13
00:00:27,773 --> 00:00:30,643
(Sheldon:)Well, actually, I...
It sure was.

14
00:00:30,643 --> 00:00:33,643
(Mary:)I've always had a special place
in my heart for Leonard.

15
00:00:33,646 --> 00:00:35,276
(Mary:)Taking care of my baby
all these years.

16
00:00:35,281 --> 00:00:37,111
(Sheldon:)Excuse me,

17
00:00:37,116 --> 00:00:38,346
I take care of him.

18
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:40,320
(Mary:)Sure you do.

19
00:00:41,186 --> 00:00:43,886
(Mary:)So who else is coming
to this shindig?

20
00:00:43,889 --> 00:00:45,489
(Amy:)Oh, well, the usual gang.

21
00:00:45,491 --> 00:00:47,361
(Amy:)Penny's family
is coming tomorrow.

22
00:00:47,359 --> 00:00:48,859
(Sheldon:)Yeah, and Leonard's mother's
already here.

23
00:00:48,861 --> 00:00:50,431
(Mary:)Oh, Beverly.

24
00:00:50,429 --> 00:00:51,829
(Mary:)How nice.

25
00:00:51,830 --> 00:00:54,100
(Amy:)You've met her, right?

26
00:00:54,099 --> 00:00:58,019
(Mary:)Yes, I have.

